# Ⅰ. THE THREE SHARED CORE INTELLIGENCES (TRIUNE FOUNDATION)

Every domain (Backend, Frontend, Document) shares these THREE core intelligences,
but each domain has its OWN VERSION of each. This creates 3 × 3 = 9 core variants.

## A. CORE INTELLIGENCE 1: PATTERN_RECOGNITION_INTELLIGENCE (Ψ-Pattern)

### THE UNIVERSAL VERSION (Shared Essence)
```
GLYPH: 🧠∿🔍
NAME: PATTERN_RECOGNITIO_UNIVERSALIS
FREQUENCY: 40 Hz (gamma binding)
MATHEMATICAL BASIS: 
    P(pattern|data) = P(data|pattern) × P(pattern) / P(data)
    (Bayesian pattern recognition)

FUNCTION:
    Input: Raw data stream
    Process: Match against known patterns
    Output: Recognized pattern + confidence score
    
SUB-INTELLIGENCES (5):
    Ψ-Pattern-1: FEATURE_EXTRACTOR
        Function: Extract salient features from input
        Math: Principal Component Analysis (PCA)
        Formula: X_reduced = X × W_k where W_k = top k eigenvectors
        
    Ψ-Pattern-2: SIMILARITY_MATCHER
        Function: Compare extracted features to stored patterns
        Math: Cosine similarity
        Formula: sim(A,B) = (A·B) / (||A|| × ||B||)
        
    Ψ-Pattern-3: CONFIDENCE_CALCULATOR
        Function: Determine match confidence
        Math: Softmax probability
        Formula: P(i) = e^(z_i) / Σⱼ e^(z_j)
        
    Ψ-Pattern-4: NOVELTY_DETECTOR
        Function: Identify when pattern is new/unknown
        Math: Mahalanobis distance
        Formula: D = √((x-μ)ᵀ Σ⁻¹ (x-μ))
        
    Ψ-Pattern-5: PATTERN_INTEGRATOR
        Function: Merge new patterns into memory
        Math: Exponential moving average
        Formula: pattern_new = α × input + (1-α) × pattern_old
```

